\" id=\"fu-seal\" src=\"/assets/default2/fu-siegel-web-schwarz-684a4d11be3c3400d8906a344a77c9a4.png\" /><div id=\"fu-seal-description\">The Latin words veritas, iustitia, and libertas, which frame the seal of Freie Universit\u00e4t Berlin, stand for the values that have defined the academic ethos of Freie Universit\u00e4t since its founding in December 1948.</div></div></div></div></footer></div><script src=\"/assets/default2/henry-55a2f6b1df7f8729fca2d550689240e9.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script></div></body></html>", "http_status": 200, "error": "", "final_url": "https://www.fu-berlin.de/en/sites/drs/funding/nafoeg/index.html"}